// Status: stable
// Level: high
// Author: Thomas Patzke
// Date: 2017-02-19
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1098
// Description: Detects potential attempts made to set the Directory Services Restore Mode administrator password.
// The Directory Service Restore Mode (DSRM) account is a local administrator account on Domain Controllers.
// Attackers may change the password in order to obtain persistence.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (winlog.event_id == 4794)
